'''Magnet''' is a {{Mythical}} [[Natural]]-type of [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|6,000,000}} or {{Robux|3,500}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Magnet grants the user the power of magnetokinesis, allowing the user to control metallic objects and manipulate magnetic forces in combat. 

Collecting metal scraps fills a Magnetic Power meter; as it charges, the user's mechanical arms grow larger—boosting M1 attack speed, combo extensions, and damage reduction. When completely filled, the meter allows the user to transform into a large robot with metal and magnet-themed abilities and passives. Flight is available in both base form and when transformed.

